e":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162434042,"discussion_id":"9f97fc26b63d756b751fc0cbe267267c57459160","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-06T11:55:43+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T11:55:43+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162434068,"discussion_id":"dad514560677f1f3d9bcfcb1109af4feee233d6b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复直方图算子（histc）在特定硬件架构（DAV_2201 或 RegBase）下存在的逻辑缺陷。原逻辑错误地跳过了对用户输入的最小值（min）和最大值（max）的重新计算，当用户提供的 min 和 max 值相等或差值极小时，会导致直方图计算错误。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是反转了 `NeedComputeMinMax` 函数中的条件判断逻辑。将原先“在特定架构下不重新计算”的逻辑，改为“仅在非特定架构下不重新计算”。这确保了在 DAV_2201 和 RegBase 架构下，当用户传入的边界值无效时，算子会正确地从输入张量中重新计算实际的最小值和最大值，从而保证计算结果的正确性。该修改属于低风险的逻辑修复，不涉及新增接口或依赖。","created_at":"2026-02-06T11:55:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T11:55:54+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162434156,"discussion_id":"c84350e17b0260e3cea9601eadc38bd7384b4a3c","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-02-06T11:56:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T11:56:22+08:00","user":{"id":"68ff1c80ca3ed44ec80508e4","login":"xjhqre0","object_id":"68ff1c80ca3ed44ec80508e4","name":"xjhqre0","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xjhqre0"},"commen